n"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["Pricing follows the same distance-based structure in ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/services/car-recovery/riyadh","children":"Riyadh"}],", ",["$","$L25","a-1",{"href":"/services/car-recovery/jeddah","children":"Jeddah"}],", and ",["$","$L25","a-2",{"href":"/services/car-recovery/dammam","children":"Dammam"}],". In ",["$","$L25","a-3",{"href":"/services/car-recovery/makkah","children":"Makkah"}]," and ",["$","$L25","a-4",{"href":"/services/car-recovery/madinah","children":"Madinah"}],", central-area access restrictions can mean a slightly higher starting point."]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"roadside-services-no-towing-needed","children":"Roadside Services (No Towing Needed)"}],"\n",["$","ul","ul-1",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Battery jump start:"}]," a quick roadside job, priced lower than a full tow"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Flat tire change (your spare):"}]," a quick roadside job, priced lower than a full tow"]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Fuel delivery:"}]," the roadside callout plus the cost of the fuel itself"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"intercity-car-transport-costs","children":"Intercity Car Transport Costs"}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"Intercity transport is priced by route and distance rather than a flat rate — a short corridor like Jeddah–Makkah costs less than a long haul like Jeddah–Riyadh. Share your route and vehicle and we confirm the exact price on WhatsApp before booking."}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":["Moving a car permanently? See our full ",["$","$L25","a-0",{"href":"/blog/car-transport-between-saudi-cities","children":"guide to transporting a car between Saudi cities"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","h3","h3-3",{"id":"what-changes-the-price","children":"What Changes the Price?"}],"\n",["$","ol","ol-0",{"children":["\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f","\n",